const layout = @import("layout.zig");
const compensation = @import("compensation.zig");
const company_questions = @import("company_questions.zig");
const stage_timeline = @import("stage_timeline.zig");
const view_models = @import("../view_models.zig");

pub templ ProcessDetailContent(view: view_models.ProcessDetail) {
    <div class="actions">
        <a class="secondary" href="/">← Dashboard</a>
        <a class="button" href={view.edit_url}>Edit process</a>
    </div>
    <section class="panel process-hero">
        <h1>{view.company_name}</h1>
        <h2>{view.position_name}</h2>
        <p class="process-meta"><span class="badge">{view.status}</span> · Applied {view.applied_at}</p>
        if (view.source.len > 0) { <p class="process-source">{view.source}</p> }
        @RatingsSection(view.ratings)
        <h3>About</h3>
        if (view.company_summary.len > 0) {
            <p class="preserve-lines">{view.company_summary}</p>
        } else {
            <p class="muted">Not recorded.</p>
        }
        <div class="process-secondary">
            if (view.job_url) |job_url| { <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href={job_url} hx-boost="false">Job posting</a> }
            if (view.location.len > 0) { <span>{view.location}</span> }
            if (view.work_arrangement.len > 0) { <span>{view.work_arrangement}</span> }
        </div>
    </section>
    @compensation.CompensationSection(view.compensation)
    @stage_timeline.StageTimeline(view.timeline)
    @company_questions.CompanyQuestions(view.company_questions)
    <section class="panel danger-zone">
        <h2>Danger zone</h2>
        <p>This permanently deletes the job process and all stages, notes, questions, appointments and compensation records.</p>
        <form
            method="post"
            action={view.delete_url}
            hx-post={view.delete_url}
            hx-confirm="Delete this job process and all associated data?"
        >
            <button class="danger" type="submit">Delete job process</button>
        </form>
    </section>
}

templ RatingSelect(name: []const u8, value: []const u8) {
    <select name={name} aria-label={name}>
        <option value="" selected={if (value.len == 0) "selected" else null}>Not rated</option>
        <option value="1" selected={if (std.mem.eql(u8, value, "1")) "selected" else null}>1</option>
        <option value="2" selected={if (std.mem.eql(u8, value, "2")) "selected" else null}>2</option>
        <option value="3" selected={if (std.mem.eql(u8, value, "3")) "selected" else null}>3</option>
        <option value="4" selected={if (std.mem.eql(u8, value, "4")) "selected" else null}>4</option>
        <option value="5" selected={if (std.mem.eql(u8, value, "5")) "selected" else null}>5</option>
    </select>
}

pub templ RatingsSection(view: view_models.RatingsSection) {
    <section id="process-ratings" class="process-ratings">
        <h2>My rating</h2>
        <dl>
            <dt>Interest</dt><dd>{view.interest}</dd>
            <dt>Money</dt><dd>{view.money}</dd>
            <dt>Growth</dt><dd>{view.growth}</dd>
        </dl>
        <details class="inline-form" open={if (view.errors.interest_rating != null or view.errors.money_rating != null or view.errors.growth_rating != null) "open" else null}>
            <summary>Edit ratings</summary>
            <form method="post" action={view.action} hx-post={view.action} hx-target="#process-ratings" hx-swap="outerHTML">
                <div class="form-grid ratings-grid">
                    <label>Interest @RatingSelect("interest_rating", view.interest_value)</label>
                    <label>Money @RatingSelect("money_rating", view.money_value)</label>
                    <label>Growth @RatingSelect("growth_rating", view.growth_value)</label>
                </div>
                <button type="submit">Save ratings</button>
            </form>
        </details>
    </section>
}

pub templ ProcessDetailPage(view: view_models.ProcessDetail) {
    @layout.Layout(view.title) { @ProcessDetailContent(view) }
}

pub templ ProcessDetailFragment(view: view_models.ProcessDetail) {
    <title>{view.title} · Interview CRM</title>
    @ProcessDetailContent(view)
}
